  "cleanText": "Solution home \n\t\tCapisign v2.0\n\t\tCapisign Help Guide\n\n### Capisign: Sending a file from Self Assessment for e-signing\n\n\t\t\tPrint\n\n\tModified on: Tue, 4 Apr, 2023 at  9:03 AM\n\n\t\tTo send a file from Self Assessment to Capisign you can click on this link. Alternatively you can also follow the navigation as shown below.\n\nNavigation: Self Assessment > Client Specific\n\nStep 1 - Once you are in Self Assessment, select the specific client \n\nStep 2 - You will see a list of already generated Self Assessment Returns, select the ‘Action’ dropdown and then select ‘Send to Capisign’\n\nStep 3 - You will then be taken to the Capisign module where you can view the document and receive an email update. The client will receive an email link to e sign the document and the Capisign status will change to 'Signed' once they have completed the e-signing\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDid you find it helpful?\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tYes\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tNo\n\nSend feedback\tSorry we couldn't be helpful. Help us improve this article with your feedback.",
  "bodyHtml": "\n\t<div class=\"breadcrumb\">\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions\"> Solution home </a>\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions/9000117934\">Capisign v2.0</a>\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions/folders/9000197763\">Capisign Help Guide</a>\n\t</div>\n\t<b class=\"page-stamp page-stamp-article\">\n\t\t<b class=\"icon-page-article\"></b>\n\t</b>\n\n\t<h2 class=\"heading\">Capisign: Sending a file from Self Assessment for e-signing\n\t \t<a href=\"#\"\n            class=\"solution-print--icon print--remove\"\n \t\t\ttitle=\"Print this Article\"\n \t\t\tarial-role=\"link\"\n \t\t\tarial-label=\"Print this Article\"\n\t\t\tid=\"print-article\"\n \t\t>\n\t\t\t<span class=\"icon-print\"></span>\n\t\t\t<span class=\"text-print\">Print</span>\n \t\t</a>\n\t</h2>\n\t\n\t<p>Modified on: Tue, 4 Apr, 2023 at  9:03 AM</p>\n\t<hr />\n\t\n\n\t<article class=\"article-body\" id=\"article-body\" rel=\"image-enlarge\">\n\t\t<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">To send a file from Self Assessment to Capisign you can <a href=\"https://app.capium.com/selfassessment/sa100/\"><strong>click on this link</strong></a>. Alternatively you can also follow the navigation as shown below.</span></p><p><br></p><p></p><div style=\"position: relative; padding-bottom: 56.25%; height: 0;\"><iframe src=\"https://www.loom.com/embed/54c117f3817f409aab68f374eb68dbd4\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"\" style=\"position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%;\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-forms allow-same-origin allow-presentation\"></iframe></div><p></p><p><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Roboto, sans-serif; color: rgb(32, 33, 36); font-weight: 400;\"><strong>Navigation</strong><strong>:</strong> Self Assessment &gt; Client Specific</span></p><p><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Roboto, sans-serif; color: rgb(32, 33, 36); font-weight: 400;\"><strong>Step 1</strong> - Once you are in Self Assessment, select the specific client&nbsp;</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Roboto, sans-serif; color: rgb(32, 33, 36); font-weight: 400;\"><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9182747386/original/z8J3HYfmmiJUblJdCxVul_WWaF5Z1D9B4g.png?1679396884\" style=\"width: auto;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"9182747386\"></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Roboto, sans-serif; color: rgb(32, 33, 36); font-weight: 400;\"><strong>Step 2</strong> - You will see a list of already generated Self Assessment Returns, select the ‘Action’ dropdown and then select ‘Send to Capisign’</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Roboto, sans-serif; color: rgb(32, 33, 36); font-weight: 400;\"><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9182747425/original/C7uOs83t_Deab_H3QPjCGCMRW61CpItU_Q.png?1679396936\" style=\"width: auto;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"9182747425\"></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Roboto, sans-serif; color: rgb(32, 33, 36); font-weight: 400;\"><strong>Step 3</strong> - You will then be taken to the Capisign module where you can view the document and receive an email update. The client will receive an email link to e sign the document and the Capisign status will change to 'Signed' once they have completed the e-signing</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Roboto, sans-serif; color: rgb(32, 33, 36); font-weight: 400;\"><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9182747473/original/wyUcMxpFk-emWH79O8h-cPdTroOR9_sRGw.png?1679397005\" style=\"width: auto;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"9182747473\"></span><br></p>\n\t</article>\n\n\t<hr />\t\n\t\t\n\n\t\t<p class=\"article-vote\" id=\"voting-container\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-user-id=\"\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-article-id=\"9000225736\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-language=\"en\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDid you find it helpful?<span data-href=\"/support/solutions/articles/9000225736/thumbs_up\" class=\"vote-up a-link\" id=\"article_thumbs_up\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-remote=\"true\" data-method=\"put\" data-update=\"#voting-container\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-user-id=\"\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-article-id=\"9000225736\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-language=\"en\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-update-with-message=\"Glad we could be helpful. Thanks for the feedback.\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tYes</span><span class=\"vote-down-container\"><span data-href=\"/support/solutions/articles/9000225736/thumbs_down\" class=\"vote-down a-link\" id=\"article_thumbs_down\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-remote=\"true\" data-method=\"put\" data-update=\"#vote-feedback-form\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-user-id=\"\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-article-id=\"9000225736\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-language=\"en\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-hide-dom=\"#voting-container\" data-show-dom=\"#vote-feedback-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tNo</span></span></p><a class=\"hide a-link\" id=\"vote-feedback-form-link\" data-hide-dom=\"#vote-feedback-form-link\" data-show-dom=\"#vote-feedback-container\">Sen